  "id": "chinese-style-braised-beef-one-pot",
  "name": "Chinese-Style Braised Beef One-Pot",
  "subtitle": "Slow-braised beef with ginger, five-spice, and soy",
  "description": "Beef is seasoned, browned, and slowly braised with aromatic ginger, chili, five-spice, wine, soy, and stock. Serve with steamed bok choi and basmati rice.",
